        "source": "have fn r43_square_root_two_residual(x R) R = x^2 - 2\nclaim:\n    ? forall x R+:\n        (x + 2 / x) / 2 $in R+\n    2 / x > 0\n    x + 2 / x > 0\n\nhave fn r43_newton_sqrt_two(x R+) R+ = (x + 2 / x) / 2\n\nthm r43_newton_sqrt_two_residual_identity:\n    ? forall x R+:\n        4 * x^2 * r43_square_root_two_residual(r43_newton_sqrt_two(x)) = r43_square_root_two_residual(x)^2\n    r43_newton_sqrt_two(x) = (x + 2 / x) / 2\n    r43_square_root_two_residual(x) = x^2 - 2\n    r43_square_root_two_residual(r43_newton_sqrt_two(x)) = r43_newton_sqrt_two(x)^2 - 2 = ((x + 2 / x) / 2)^2 - 2\n    4 * x^2 * r43_square_root_two_residual(r43_newton_sqrt_two(x)) = 4 * x^2 * (((x + 2 / x) / 2)^2 - 2) = (x^2 - 2)^2 = r43_square_root_two_residual(x)^2\n\nthm r43_newton_sqrt_two_residual_nonnegative:\n    ? forall x R+:\n        r43_square_root_two_residual(r43_newton_sqrt_two(x)) >= 0\n    release thm r43_newton_sqrt_two_residual_identity(x)\n    x^2 > 0\n    4*x^2 > 0\n    r43_square_root_two_residual(x)^2 >= 0\n    r43_square_root_two_residual(r43_newton_sqrt_two(x))=r43_square_root_two_residual(x)^2/(4*x^2)>=0\n\nthm r43_greater_original:\n    ? forall x R+:\n        r43_newton_sqrt_two(x) > 1\n    x > 0\n    x != 0\n    2 * x != 0\n    r43_newton_sqrt_two(x) = (x + 2 / x) / 2\n    r43_newton_sqrt_two(x) - 1 = (x + 2 / x) / 2 - 1\n    (x + 2 / x) / 2 - 1 = ((x - 1)^2 + 1) / (2 * x)\n    r43_newton_sqrt_two(x) - 1 = ((x - 1)^2 + 1) / (2 * x)\n    (x - 1)^2 >= 0\n    (x - 1)^2 + 1 > 0\n    2 * x > 0\n    ((x - 1)^2 + 1) / (2 * x) > 0\n    r43_newton_sqrt_two(x) - 1 > 0\n\n# Induction propagates the one-step lower bound through the recursive iterate.\n",
